4. Important Migration Rule — Team Key and Fix Version

Throughout the application, ensure the existing migration rules are preserved.

Team Key

Use team key as the primary business identifier wherever applicable.

Do not reintroduce unnecessary project-key dependency.

Fix Version

The complete fix-version string must always be preserved.

This is extremely important.

Do NOT:

* truncate the fix version
* remove spaces
* split the fix version incorrectly
* normalize it incorrectly
* remove words
* alter its case unnecessarily
* send only part of the fix version

The exact fix-version value selected by the user must travel through:

UI → API → Python service → database → queries → downstream processing

and must match the Java implementation.

